# The build context is an allow-list: only what `cargo build` and the image's COPY lines need.
# (Everything else — docs, the web UI, SDKs, examples, CI files — cannot change the image, so it must not
# be able to invalidate a layer either.)
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!crates
!proto
!migrations
!deploy/docker/ag-server.toml

# ...minus build output, local state and tests that may sit inside the allowed directories.
**/target
**/.ag
**/node_modules
crates/*/tests
crates/*/proptest-regressions
